# Allow only source code and the existing profile/track templates into the build.
# Never send local databases, Garmin credentials, AI keys, or .git to Docker.
**
!catalyst-app/
!catalyst-app/package.json
!catalyst-app/package-lock.json
!catalyst-app/tsconfig.json
!catalyst-app/tsconfig.main.json
!catalyst-app/vite.config.ts
!catalyst-app/src/
!catalyst-app/src/**
!catalyst-app/scripts/
!catalyst-app/scripts/**
!tracks/
!tracks/*.yaml
!Lotus/
!Lotus/*.md
!Vette/
!Vette/*.md
